description.text:
One single piercing attack at True Cap Break Level 1, grants Instant ATB 1 & Instant Cast 1 to user;
During Tactical Awoken Mode, Cap Break Level 2 & ATB Speed x1.2 to Earth/Fire Abilities, and Weapon Skill Blue/Gold if there are at least 0/4 Monk/IV members;
WS Blue: Instant Physical to user
WS Gold: Instant Physical to party

